Ultimately, bull markets die on euphoria, which is, you know, I'm not greedy, Meb, I just want 15, 20% returns and no risk.

76
00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:28.560
And uh I, you know, we're we're entering the fifth year of a bull market, but I, you know, I really all year I've said a tremendous level of anxiety uh by investors about the stock market.

77
00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:51.840
So typically a bull market cycle lasts five to seven years, but I think usually at this joke you see a lot more enthusiasm uh that I that I perceive, which is why the multiple has not kept up with, or the market has not kept up with this big earnings explosion to the upside, um, then ultimately I don't think it will be different.

78
00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:56.480
